      <cyrillic>гүнжгий</cyrillic>
      <transcript>GYNGZYGEI</transcript>
      <definition>[=gynzegei] adj. and n. Deep, profound serious; depth, profundity, profoundness.</definition>
      <page>391</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠥᠩᠵᠥᠺᠡᠢ ᠪᠣᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- bolxu</transcript>
          <definition> To become deep, sink in</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠦᠨ ᠭᠥᠩᠵᠥᠺᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>gyn --</transcript>
          <definition> Deep, profound.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠦᠨ ᠭᠥᠩᠵᠥᠺᠡᠢ ᠠᠰᠠᠭᠤᠯᠲᠠ</unicode>
